              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esekhulume ngomphongolo kaNkulunkulu, wawa nyovane esihlalweni esingasesangweni, yaphuka intamo, wafa, ngokuba wayeyindoda endala enzima. Futhi wahola u-Israyeli iminyaka engamashumi amane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.18"
            ]
