              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngesikhathi sokufa kwakhe abesifazane ababemi khona bathi kuye: “Ungesabi; ngoba uzele indodana. Kodwa akazange aphendule, futhi akazange akucabange lokho.",
